1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Findagrave  MEMORIAL ID   225050369 
2 CONT Biological parents were Charles A Stander and Amanda Nystrom. Amanda Sofia Nystrom was born November 13, 1870 in Motala, Sweden. She immigrated in 1889. She wed Charles A Stander on June 12, 1895 at Salem Lutheran Church in Chicag
2 CONC o. She passed on November 19, 1917 at the Peoria State Hospital where she was a patient for almost 12 years. She was buried in the cemetery there on November 20, 1917.
2 CONT
2 CONT Peoria State Hospital in Bartonville was home to thousands of psychiatric patients, one reform-minded administrator and arguably the area's greatest ghost story.
2 CONT
2 CONT The family fell on tough times and fell apart and the children were placed in different homes. Mae resided with August memorial 197404923 and Amanda memorial 225071067 Johnson in 1910.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her biological siblings include
2 CONT Charles Oberg memorial 225030734
2 CONT Julia Bivens memorial 16636843
2 CONT Charles, Julia and Mae can be found on the 1900 Census with their birth parents.
2 CONT Biological siblings born after 1900
2 CONT Olga Schreiber memorial 225051128
2 CONT Ruth Cornell memorial 43714121
