1 NOTE {geni:about_me} “Sven Jonsson Höckert was born 1785-03-09 in Tyllinge, Dalhem. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He became Livgrenadjör (Grenadier) at the Kungliga Första Livgrenadjärregementet Kinda Company root Hökhult, Horn 1808-1839 (hence the name). Soldattorpet called Kåven. He died 1859-01-03 in Höckersborg, Höckhults estate, Horn fro
2 CONC m chest fever. He was married on 1810-01-04 to Elisabeth Charlotta Andersdtr born 1788-06-30 in Horn and d 1854-04-29 in Höckersborg, Höckhults estate, Horn.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sven was the son of Jonas Wåhlstrand, who was the Bailiff (''Befallningsman'' or ''Betjänt'') of Tyllinge for [http://www.geni.com/people/Baron-Sven-Johan-Duwall/6000000018924067437 Baron Sven Johan Duwall] (1746-1819). The Baron 
2 CONC was Sven's godfather.
